# Elvish Archivist: "Whenever one or more artifacts you control enter, put two +1/+1 counters on this creature. This ability
# triggers only once each turn." The 0/1 Archivist is in play on turn 1 when Bot1's Mox Ruby enters (CR 603.6a): it becomes 2/3, and
# the Mox Pearl cast right after, the same turn, adds nothing more (CR 603.2). Bot2's Mox Emerald on turn 2 is not an artifact Bot1
# controls. On turn 3 the ability triggers again for the Mox Sapphire, and not for the Black Lotus after it: 4/5 and no further.

